    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e38b1bbf40dbb3071ca5db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花在这三年里，\n出色地跑出了属于她的 风范。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7660a7ae23153368aae3ca6a523e8f40fee995351a073fa4298624664406d10f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57d1d44c930a72b38b6d3965",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以温柔为武器，怀揣着坚定的觉悟。\n那样的轨迹，\n才缔造了那天的『日本杯』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87be9998f3c9dee30dc79b555893fe75a06fcfb55feb5403f2088ba0bf876261",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
